# Client stub (SPEC §9). Works with Visual Studio, Rider and the VS Code REST Client.
# docker compose → 8080; dotnet run (launchSettings "http") → 5080
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness (includes database)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Correlation id is echoed back
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
X-Correlation-Id: demo-request-001

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Appointments (seed data: src/Scheduler.Infrastructure/Persistence/SeedIds.cs)
# Pick a start time 1 hour – 60 days ahead, on a 15-minute boundary, Mon–Sat 08:00–17:00 local.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
@d1 = d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@customerAn = c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@vehicleAnAccord = ae000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@vehicleBinhModel3 = ae000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@oilChange = 5e000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@start = 2026-12-22T09:00:00+07:00

### Book an oil change (201 Created; repeat to get 409 SLOT_UNAVAILABLE only when every Lift bay is taken)
# @name book
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-book-001

{
  "customerId": "{{customerAn}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleAnAccord}}",
  "dealershipId": "{{d1}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{oilChange}}",
  "startTime": "{{start}}",
  "notes": "Strange noise from front left wheel"
}

### Read the appointment just created
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{book.response.body.$.id}}

### 409 VEHICLE_ALREADY_BOOKED: same vehicle, overlapping window
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerAn}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleAnAccord}}",
  "dealershipId": "{{d1}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{oilChange}}",
  "startTime": "2026-12-22T09:30:00+07:00"
}

### 422 VEHICLE_NOT_OWNED: Binh's car booked by An
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerAn}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleBinhModel3}}",
  "dealershipId": "{{d1}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{oilChange}}",
  "startTime": "{{start}}"
}

### 400 INVALID_START_TIME: not on a 15-minute boundary
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerAn}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleAnAccord}}",
  "dealershipId": "{{d1}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{oilChange}}",
  "startTime": "2026-12-22T09:10:00+07:00"
}

### 400 VALIDATION_FAILED: missing fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notes": "no ids" }

### 404 APPOINTMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Availability (FR-06)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Open start times for an oil change on a day
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/availability?dealershipId={{d1}}&serviceTypeId={{oilChange}}&date=2026-12-22

### Sunday: closed, empty list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/availability?dealershipId={{d1}}&serviceTypeId={{oilChange}}&date=2026-12-20

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cancellation (FR-07) and idempotency (FR-08)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Cancel the appointment booked above (run "Book an oil change" first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{book.response.body.$.id}}/cancel

### Cancel again: 409 APPOINTMENT_NOT_CANCELLABLE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{book.response.body.$.id}}/cancel

### Idempotent booking: send twice, the second answer carries Idempotency-Replayed: true and the same id
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

{
  "customerId": "{{customerAn}}",
  "vehicleId": "ae000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "dealershipId": "{{d1}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{oilChange}}",
  "startTime": "2026-12-22T13:00:00+07:00"
}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reference data (FR-09)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Dealerships
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dealerships

### Service types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/service-types

### Vehicles of a customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerAn}}/vehicles

